      "value": "two crossed booms along the diagonals, 78.28 m tip to tip, three telescoping sections of radius 60 / 48 / 36 mm",
      "source": "Reflect Orbital, 'Figure 2: Deployed Configuration' (four triangular quadrants, 18000 mm per side, two crossed booms along the diagonals, a 2439.59 mm central bus; the user's reference qa/waves/20261104/1.png, with the render 2.png), 2026-11-04; the section radii are estimates (unpublished)."
    },
    {
