      ],
      "status": "derived",
      "value": "2.44 x 0.70 x 0.50 m bus behind a 0.4 m deployer hub, a solar panel on its back",
      "source": "Reflect Orbital, 'Figure 2: Deployed Configuration' (four triangular quadrants, 18000 mm per side, two crossed booms along the diagonals, a 2439.59 mm central bus; the user's reference qa/waves/20261104/1.png, with the render 2.png), 2026-11-04 (the 2439.59 mm dimension); width, depth and the panel are estimates."
